Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: Tesserafin
Source: https://github.com/tesserafin-project/tesserafin

Comment: This package bundles three separately licensed works. They are listed
 here as separate stanzas because they are separate: bundling a GPL-3.0-or-later
 media runtime alongside a GPL-2.0-or-later server does not relicense the server,
 and stating one licence for the whole package would misdescribe both.
 .
 The complete corresponding source for the bundled FFmpeg runtime is distributed
 as a separate archive alongside this package; see
 /usr/share/doc/tesserafin-server/FFMPEG-CORRESPONDING-SOURCE.txt for its exact
 filename and SHA-256.

Files: *
Copyright: Tesserafin Project contributors
License: GPL-2.0-or-later
Comment: The Tesserafin server application, its systemd unit and its
 configuration. Built from server source at the commit recorded in the package
 description and in the artifact provenance manifest. Full text at
 @SERVER_LICENSE_PATH@.

Files: usr/lib/tesserafin/ffmpeg/*
 usr/share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/*
 usr/share/licenses/tesserafin-server/ffmpeg/*
Copyright: the FFmpeg authors and the authors of every statically linked component
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
Comment: The Tesserafin FFmpeg runtime, build revision @F0_BUILD_REVISION@,
 built from source at @F0_UPSTREAM_REPOSITORY@ commit @F0_UPSTREAM_COMMIT@ with
 --enable-gpl and --enable-version3, which makes the runtime as a whole
 GPL-3.0-or-later. It contains no nonfree component and no FDK AAC.
 .
 The per-component licence texts collected from the actual source trees are
 installed under @FFMPEG_LICENSE_PATH@; the component inventory, its licences and
 its source locations are in usr/share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/sbom.cdx.json and
 usr/share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/SOURCE.json; the third-party notices are in
 usr/share/tesserafin/ffmpeg/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Files: usr/share/tesserafin/web/*
Copyright: the Tesserafin Web contributors and the authors of its dependencies
License: GPL-2.0-or-later and the licences recorded in usr/share/tesserafin/web-licenses/
Comment: The bundled Tesserafin Web client, built from tesserafin-web commit
 @WEB_VCS_REF@. Its own third-party dependency licences are installed verbatim
 under usr/share/tesserafin/web-licenses/ and are not restated here.

License: GPL-2.0-or-later
 This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under
 the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software
 Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later
 version.
 .
 This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY
 WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A
 PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details.
 .
 The complete text is installed at @SERVER_LICENSE_PATH@. On Debian systems the
 GPL version 2 is also at /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-2.

License: GPL-3.0-or-later
 This runtime is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under
 the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software
 Foundation; either version 3 of the License, or (at your option) any later
 version.
 .
 It is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY;
 without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR
 PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details.
 .
 The complete texts, per component, are installed under @FFMPEG_LICENSE_PATH@. On
 Debian systems the GPL version 3 is also at /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3.
